  "body": "\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span><ruby>게<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby><ruby>ᄋᅷ<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby></span></h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/2c_OzqOHuU8?version=3&amp;rel=1&amp;showsearch=0&amp;showinfo=1&amp;iv_load_policy=1&amp;fs=1&amp;hl=en&amp;autohide=2&amp;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">漢諺混寫 Hanri-Hangul mixed script</h3>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n    <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n        <ruby>有<rt>우-</rt></ruby><ruby>一日<rt>짇띧ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>란<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>若<rt>나</rt></ruby><ruby>老<rt>ᄅᅷˉ</rt></ruby>\n    </span>\n    <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n        u-jit-rît làn na-lāu\n    </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>揣<rt>췌-</rt></ruby><ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>人<rt>랑ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>共<rt>가-</rt></ruby><ruby>란<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>有孝<rt>유ˆᄒᅷ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    chue-bo-láng ka-làn yû-hau\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>會<rt>에-</rt></ruby><ruby>陪<rt>붸-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>坐<rt>제-</rt></ruby><ruby>恬<rt>댬-</rt></ruby><ruby>椅條<rt>이ˆᄅᆤˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    goà e-pue-lì je-tiam-î-liáu\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n    <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n        <ruby>聽<rt>턀ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>講<rt>겅ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>少年<rt>ᄉᆤˋ롄ˊ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>時陣<rt>시준ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>有<rt>우-</rt></ruby><ruby>偌<rt>똬-</rt></ruby><ruby>𠢕<rt>ᄁᅷˊ</rt></ruby>\n    </span>\n    <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n        thiā̰-lì kông-siàu-lién’e si-jūn lì u-roa-gáu\n    </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n    <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n        <ruby>食好<rt>쟣호ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>食<rt>쟣-</rt></ruby><ruby>䆀<rt>빼ˋ</rt></ruby>, <ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>計較<rt>게ˋᄀᅷ</rt></ruby>\n    </span>\n    <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n        jiah-hò jiah-bài, bo-kè-kau\n    </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n    <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n        <ruby>怨天<rt>완ˋ틸ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>怨地<rt>완ˋ되ˉ</rt></ruby>, <ruby>嘛<rt>마-</rt></ruby><ruby>𣍐<rt>뾔-</rt></ruby><ruby>曉<rt>ᄒᆤˋ</rt></ruby>\n    </span>\n    <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n        oàn-thḭ̂ oàn-toē, ma-boe-hiàu\n    </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>手<rt>츄ˋ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>會<rt>에-</rt></ruby>가<ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>牽<rt>칸ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>牢牢<rt>ᄃᆤᄃᆤˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    lì’e chiù, goà e-ka-lì khān-tiau-tiáu\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n    <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n        <ruby>因為<rt>인ˉ위-</rt></ruby><ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>是<rt>시ˉ</rt></ruby>, <ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>家後<rt>게ˉᄋᅷˉ</rt></ruby>\n    </span>\n    <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n        īn-wi-goà sī, lì&#8217;e kē-āu\n    </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>꾼<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>將<rt>졍ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>青春<rt>촁ˉ춘ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>嫁<rt>게ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>佇<rt>듸-</rt></ruby><ruby>린<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>兜<rt>ᄃᅷˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    gùn jiōng-chiēng-chûn kè-ti-lîn-tâu\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>꾼<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>𨘗<rt>뒤ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>少年<rt>ᄉᆤˋ롄ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>綴<rt>뒈ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>綴<rt>뒈ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>徦<rt>갛ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>老<rt>ᄅᅷˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    gùn tùi-siàu-lién tuè-lì tuè-kâh-lāu\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n    <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n        <ruby>人情<rt>띤졩ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>世事<rt>세ˋ수ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>已經<rt>이ˆ곙ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>看透透<rt>콸ˋᄐᅷˋᄐᅷ</rt></ruby>\n    </span>\n    <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n        rin-jiéng sè-sū î-kiēng-khoà̰-thàu-thau\n    </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>有<rt>우-</rt></ruby><ruby>啥人<rt>샬ˆ랑ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>比<rt>비ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>較<rt>캏ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>重要<rt>뎡ᄋᆤ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    u-siâ̰-láng pî-lì khâh-tiong-yau\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n    <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n        <ruby>꾼<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>一生<rt>읻ˆ솅ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>獻<rt>혠ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>予<rt>허-</rt></ruby><ruby>린<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>兜<rt>ᄃᅷˆ</rt></ruby>\n    </span>\n    <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n        gùn&#8217;e ît-siêng hièn-hor-lîn-tâu\n    </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>才<rt>쟣ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>知<rt>재ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>幸福<rt>혱헉</rt></ruby> <ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>吵吵鬧鬧<rt>차ˆ차ˆᄂᅷᄂᅷˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    jiâh-jāi-hieng-hork si-châ-châ-nau-nāu\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n    <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n        <ruby>等待<rt>단ˆ태-</rt></ruby><ruby>轉<rt>등ˋ</rt></ruby>’킈에 <ruby>時陣<rt>시준ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>若<rt>나</rt></ruby><ruby>到<rt>ᄀᅷ</rt></ruby>\n    </span>\n    <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n        tân-thai-tǹg’khi-e si-jūn na-kau\n    </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n    <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n        <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>會<rt>에-</rt></ruby><ruby>讓<rt>뉴-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>先<rt>솅ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>走<rt>ᄌᅷˋ</rt></ruby>\n    </span>\n    <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n        goà e-niu-lì siēng-jàu\n    </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n    <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n        <ruby>因為<rt>인ˉ위-</rt></ruby><ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>會<rt>에-</rt></ruby><ruby>毋<rt>음-</rt></ruby><ruby>甘<rt>감ˆ</rt></ruby>, <ruby>放<rt>방ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>\n    </span>\n    <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n        īn-wi-goà e-m-kâm, pàng-lì\n    </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n    <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n        <ruby>為<rt>위-</rt></ruby><ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>目滓<rt>빡새ˋ</rt></ruby><a href=\"#_ftn1\" id=\"_ftnref1\"><strong>¹</strong></a> <ruby>流<rt>ᄅᅷˊ</rt></ruby>\n    </span>\n    <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n        wi-goà bak-sài láu\n    </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n    <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n        <ruby>有<rt>우-</rt></ruby><ruby>一日<rt>짇띧ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>란<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>若<rt>나</rt></ruby><ruby>老<rt>ᄅᅷˉ</rt></ruby>\n    </span>\n    <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n        u-jit-rît làn na-lāu\n    </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n    <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n        <ruby>有<rt>우-</rt></ruby><ruby>新婦<rt>신ˉ부ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>囝兒<rt>걀ˆ띠ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>有孝<rt>유ˆᄒᅷ</rt></ruby>\n    </span>\n    <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n        u-sīn-pū kiâ̰-rí yû-hau\n    </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>若<rt>나</rt></ruby><ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>聊<rt>ᄅᆤˊ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>摕<rt>텧-</rt></ruby><ruby>란<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>相片<rt>셩ˋ필</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    lì na-bo-liáu, theh-làn’e siòng-phḭ\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n    <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n        <ruby>看<rt>콸ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>較<rt>캏ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>早<rt>자ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>結婚<rt>곋ˆ훈ˆ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>時陣<rt>시준ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>偌<rt>똬-</rt></ruby><ruby>緣投<rt>옌ᄃᅷˊ</rt></ruby>\n    </span>\n    <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n        khoà̰-khâh-jà kiêt-hûn’e si-jūn lì roa-yen-táu\n    </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n    <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n        <ruby>穿好<rt>촁호ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>穿<rt>촁-</rt></ruby><ruby>䆀<rt>빼ˋ</rt></ruby>, <ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>計較<rt>게ˋᄀᅷ</rt></ruby>\n    </span>\n    <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n        chieng-hò chieng-bài, bo-kè-kau\n    </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n    <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n        <ruby>怪東<rt>괘ˋ당ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>怪西<rt>괘ˋ새ˆ</rt></ruby>, <ruby>嘛<rt>마-</rt></ruby><ruby>𣍐<rt>뾔-</rt></ruby><ruby>曉<rt>ᄒᆤˋ</rt></ruby>\n    </span>\n    <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n        koài-tâng koài-sâi, ma-boe-hiàu\n    </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>心<rt>심ˆ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>會<rt>에-</rt></ruby><ruby>永遠<rt>옝ˆ완ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>記<rt>기ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>牢牢<rt>ᄃᆤᄃᆤˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    lì’e sîm, goà e-yêng-oân-kì-tiau-tiáu\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n    <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n        <ruby>因為<rt>인ˉ위-</rt></ruby><ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>是<rt>시ˉ</rt></ruby>, <ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>家後<rt>게ˉᄋᅷˉ</rt></ruby>\n    </span>\n    <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n        īn-wi-goà sī, lì&#8217;e kē-āu\n    </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>꾼<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>將<rt>졍ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>青春<rt>촁ˉ춘ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>嫁<rt>게ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>佇<rt>듸-</rt></ruby><ruby>린<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>兜<rt>ᄃᅷˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    gùn jiōng-chiēng-chûn kè-ti-lîn-tâu\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>꾼<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>𨘗<rt>뒤ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>少年<rt>ᄉᆤˋ롄ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>就<rt>됴-</rt></ruby><ruby>綴<rt>뒈ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>綴<rt>뒈ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>徦<rt>갛ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>老<rt>ᄅᅷˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    gùn tùi-siàu-lién tio-tuè-lì tuè-kâh-lāu\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n    <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n        <ruby>人情<rt>띤졩ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>世事<rt>세ˋ수ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>嘛<rt>마-</rt></ruby><ruby>已經<rt>이ˆ곙ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>看透透<rt>콸ˋᄐᅷˋᄐᅷ</rt></ruby>\n    </span>\n    <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n        rin-jiéng sè-sū ma-î-kiēng-khoà̰-thàu-thau\n    </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>有<rt>우-</rt></ruby><ruby>啥人<rt>샬ˆ랑ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>比<rt>비ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>較<rt>캏ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>重要<rt>뎡ᄋᆤ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    u-siâ̰-láng pî-lì khâh-tiong-yau\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n    <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n        <ruby>꾼<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>一生<rt>읻ˆ솅ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>獻<rt>혠ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>予<rt>허-</rt></ruby><ruby>린<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>兜<rt>ᄃᅷˆ</rt></ruby>\n    </span>\n    <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n        gùn&#8217;e ît-siêng hièn-hor-lîn-tâu\n    </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>才<rt>쟣ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>知<rt>재ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>幸福<rt>혱헉</rt></ruby> <ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>吵吵鬧鬧<rt>차ˆ차ˆᄂᅷᄂᅷˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    jiâh-jāi-hieng-hork si-châ-châ-nau-nāu\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n    <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n        <ruby>等待<rt>단ˆ태-</rt></ruby><ruby>轉<rt>등ˋ</rt></ruby>’킈에 <ruby>時陣<rt>시준ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>若<rt>나</rt></ruby><ruby>到<rt>ᄀᅷ</rt></ruby>\n    </span>\n    <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n        tân-thai-tǹg’khi-e si-jūn na-kau\n    </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n    <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n        <ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>就<rt>됴-</rt></ruby><ruby>讓<rt>뉴-</rt></ruby><ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>先<rt>솅ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>走<rt>ᄌᅷˋ</rt></ruby>\n    </span>\n    <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n        lì tio-niu-goà siēng-jàu\n    </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n    <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n        <ruby>因為<rt>인ˉ위-</rt></ruby><ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>會<rt>에-</rt></ruby><ruby>毋<rt>음-</rt></ruby><ruby>甘<rt>감ˆ</rt></ruby>, <ruby>看<rt>콸ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>\n    </span>\n    <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n        īn-wi-goà e-m-kâm, khoà̰-lì\n    </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n    <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n        <ruby>為<rt>위-</rt></ruby><ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>目滓<rt>빡새ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>流<rt>ᄅᅷˊ</rt></ruby>\n    </span>\n    <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n        wi-goà bak-sài láu\n    </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<table class=\"wp-block-table alignleft\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse;border: none;font-size: 16px\">\n  <tbody><tr>\n    <td style=\"border: none;vertical-align: top;min-width: 5em;padding-right: 1.5em;padding-left: 0;padding-top: 0;padding-bottom: 0\">\n  <a href=\"#_ftnref1\" id=\"_ftn1\">¹</a>\n  <i>\n    <span><ruby title=\"bak-sài\">目滓<rt>빡새ˋ</rt></ruby></span>\n  </i> :\n</td>\n    <td style=\"border: none;padding: 0\">\n      (中) 眼淚（俗字寫作「目屎」）。<br>\n      (en) Tears.\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</tbody></table>\n\n<div style=\"clear: both;margin-bottom: 1em\"></div>\n"
